      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is on 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If validation checks fail during the live patch, the rollback procedure is to run the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior rules and replays the invalidation hook. After rollback, the steps include notifying Verdant Bay, opening an incident for manual remediation, and reverting any partial replays. The validation during the patch involves running 50 synthetic approval flows plus a sample of 50 in-flight approvals marked by the customer, and if any validation fails, the rollback is triggered automatically [art_fff67d92fe41].",
