      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. This is because they have an ongoing NoiseGuard proof of concept (PoC) as a tactical alternative and there is procurement pressure to extend NoiseGuard and reduce Northstar's scope if Northstar cannot show full recovery within 6 weeks. The exact milestone at risk is the remediation plan for schema verification, shadow index build, backfill and rebuild, and validation window with these dates: schema verification by 2026-03-22, shadow index build from 2026-03-29 to 2026-04-09, backfill and rebuild from 2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30, and validation window from 2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14. The contract renewal milestone is 2026-07-01, with a 10% annual contract value credit offered if these milestones slip [art_a504e4c5b6f8, art_ac8afb52f2d3]. \n\nNo explicit ranking of other customers' likelihood to defect to cheaper tactical competitors if milestones are missed is provided, so the uniqueness of Pioneer Freight Solutions as the most likely defector is not fully established.",
