      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the following are dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems:\n\n- Arcadia Cloudworks\n- BlueHarbor Logistics\n- CedarWind Renewables\n- HelioFab Systems\n- Pacific Health Network\n- Pioneer Freight Solutions\n\nThese accounts report issues such as search relevance degradation, low-relevance matches, and misfiring runbook triggers after taxonomy updates [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026].\n\nThe following North America West Event Nexus accounts are dealing with duplicate-action problems:\n\n- Helix Assemblies Inc.\n- LedgerBright Analytics\n- LedgerPeak Software\n- MedLogix Distribution\n- Peregrine Logistics Group\n- Pioneer Grid Retail LLC\n\nThese accounts experience workflow deduplication drift during cross-system handoffs, duplicate incidents, and repeated remediation playbook runs, often linked to idempotency key mismatches and post-acquisition systems consolidation [art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].\n\nNo explicit evidence was found to confirm if any North America West Event Nexus accounts are dealing with both taxonomy/search semantics problems and duplicate-action problems simultaneously or to clarify any overlap between these problem categories among the accounts.",
